GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Get exhibitions without login
GET http://localhost:3000/api/exhibits

### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "mySecretPassword123"
}
ashiox@example.com
asdf123456

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "mySecretPassword123"
}

### Check current user
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me

### Logout
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout

### Check current user after logout
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me

### Create an AI-generated exhibit
POST http://localhost:3000/api/exhibits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalText": "I had coffee with an old friend today. We talked for hours about our childhood memories. It felt like no time had passed."
}


### Get all exhibits
GET http://localhost:3000/api/exhibits


### Get one exhibit
GET http://localhost:3000/api/exhibits/2


### Test invalid input
POST http://localhost:3000/api/exhibits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalText": ""
}
